{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54805","headline":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"战场地，古庙与灵坛（首本作「台」，兹从辛本、川本）。\n攻破城营移（辛本、川本作「遗」）故地，尽言凶败与伤残，细说与军（辛本、川本作「兵」）官。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54805.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54805","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}